# Fillet edges meeting in an uneven mitre (an extension): the ramp of
# testdata/topo/ramp.tlspr (ramp.go), its top's front edge and its edge
# along the slope picked on the turned view; New Group > Fillet Edges
# rounds them, the cylinder along the slope, which turns further, going
# on past the mitre to where it meets the front. Check Solid finds it
# sound, and again at a new radius.
file $testdata/topo/ramp.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
move 470.3 170.3
down L 470.3 170.3
up L 470.3 170.3
move 470.3 270.7
down L 470.3 270.7
up L 470.3 270.7
menu Features|Fillet Edges
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 150 125
twdown L 150 125
twup L 150 125
edit 2
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
